Arrangement ** Ring -- change the coefficient ring of an arrangement
********************************************************************

  * Operator: *note **: (Macaulay2Doc)_st_st,
  * Usage: 
        A ** K
  * Inputs:
      * A, a *note hyperplane arrangement: Arrangement,, 
      * K, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note hyperplane arrangement: Arrangement,, the hyperplane
        arrangement defined by tensoring the *note underlying ring:
        ring_lpArrangement_rp, with $K$.

Description
===========

This methods makes a new hyperplane arrangement by changing the coefficient
ring of the underlying ring.

+-----------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ[x,y];            |
+-----------------------------+
|i2 : A = arrangement{x,y,x-y}|
|                             |
|o2 = {x, y, x - y}           |
|                             |
|o2 : Hyperplane Arrangement  |
+-----------------------------+
|i3 : A' = A ** QQ            |
|                             |
|o3 = {x, y, x - y}           |
|                             |
|o3 : Hyperplane Arrangement  |
+-----------------------------+
|i4 : ring A'                 |
|                             |
|o4 = QQ[x..y]                |
|                             |
|o4 : PolynomialRing          |
+-----------------------------+
|i5 : assert(R =!= ring A')   |
+-----------------------------+

