    dual_lpCentralArrangement_cmRing_rp, -- the Gale dual of an arrangement
  * *note dual(CentralArrangement,Ring): dual_lpCentralArrangement_cmRing_rp,
    -- the Gale dual of an arrangement
  * *note makeEssential(CentralArrangement):
    makeEssential_lpCentralArrangement_rp, -- make an essential arrangement out
    of an arbitrary one

