    in the intersection lattice
  * *note vee(Flat,Flat): vee_lpFlat_cmFlat_rp, -- compute the vee operation in
    the intersection lattice
  * *note closure(Matroid,Set): (Matroids)closure, -- closure of a subset of a
    matroid

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * "closure(Arrangement,Ideal)"
  * *note closure(Arrangement,List): closure_lpArrangement_cmList_rp, --
    closure operation in the intersection lattice
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

