compress(Arrangement) -- extract nonzero equations
**************************************************

  * Function: *note compress: (Macaulay2Doc)compress,
  * Usage: 
        compress A
  * Inputs:
      * A, a *note hyperplane arrangement: Arrangement,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note hyperplane arrangement: Arrangement,, a loopless arrangement

Description
===========

An arrangement is loopless if none of its forms are identically 0. This method
returns the arrangement defined by the non-identically-zero forms of A.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,z]                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : A = dual arrangement {x,y,x-y,z} -- the last element of this arrangement|
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {-x , x , x , 0}                                                        |
|        1   1   1                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Hyperplane Arrangement                                                  |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|is 0                                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : compress A                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = {-x , x , x }                                                           |
|        1   1   1                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Hyperplane Arrangement                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

