Flat == Flat -- whether two flats are equal
*******************************************

  * Operator: *note ==: (Macaulay2Doc)==,
  * Usage: 
        F == G
  * Inputs:
      * F, a *note flat in an hyperplane arrangement: Flat,, 
      * G, a *note flat in an hyperplane arrangement: Flat,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, whether or not F and G
        are equal

Description
===========

Two flats are equal if and only if they belong to the same *note arrangement:
arrangement_lpFlat_rp, and have the same hyperplanes.

