    arrangement
  * *note compress(Arrangement): compress_lpArrangement_rp, -- extract nonzero
    equations
  * *note restriction(Arrangement,ZZ): restriction_lpArrangement_cmIdeal_rp, --
    construct the restriction a hyperplane arrangement to a subspace

