    arrangement
  * *note ring(Arrangement): ring_lpArrangement_rp, -- get the underlying ring
    of a hyperplane arrangement

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note rank(CentralArrangement): rank_lpCentralArrangement_rp, -- compute
    the rank of a central hyperplane arrangement
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

